> **Requirement traceability.** 0.8.20 **Slice 23, leg 2** (`R-20-SV` part b). Covers
> **TC-90** (ledger `seq-128`, p1, `area: engine`) and **TC-91** (ledger `seq-129`, p2).
> **CHARACTERIZATION ONLY — NO FIX**, per steward ruling **`seq-136`**: characterize inside
> 0.8.20, fix at **0.8.21**. `src/rust/crates/fathomdb-engine/src/lib.rs` is **byte-identical**
> to the baseline in the commit that lands this document.
> **Primary design of record / template:** `dev/design/0.8.20-tc57-write-race-characterization.md`
> — §1's repro protocol and §1.4's acceptance bar are the shape followed here, and its §0 is the
> warning that earns the ordering. `dev/design/errors.md` (locked) and
> `dev/design/record-lifecycle-protocol/projection-registry-and-async-embed.md` (`status:
> UNREVIEWED` — *nobody has classified it*, which is not the same as *current*) are **consulted
> by** this document, not authority over it.

- **Baseline measured at:** `94f09d7d412784e4d02e4d03ae08d6b0e42bcad5` (branch `slice-23-sv`, leg 1 landed)
- **Harnesses:**
  - `src/rust/crates/fathomdb-engine/tests/tc90_transition_write_race.rs`
  - `src/rust/crates/fathomdb-engine/tests/tc91_duplicate_embeds_and_silent_commit_loss.rs`
