//! | arm | shape | runs | ingest duplicates / rows |
//! |---|---|---|---|
//! | [`tc91_duplicate_embed_rate_governed`] | 200 x 1-row writes, 1 ms apart | 10 | 102-106 / 200 (**52.1 %**) |
//! | [`tc91_duplicate_embed_rate_anonymous`] | same, `logical_id: None` | 10 | 103-110 / 200 (**52.8 %**) |
