385
The test asserts `open3 < open2` rather than `open3 == 0`, deliberately: the load-bearing
386
property is that the cache works, and pinning the exact zero would make an unrelated fingerprint
387
change look like a defect. If it ever fails, the "45 every open" figure is live again and every
388
embed oracle in the repo must re-subtract it.
